 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Nozomarenu Hanayome wa Ichizu ni Koutaishi wo Aisu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "望まれぬ花嫁は一途に皇太子を愛す"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Unwanted Bride… But She Loves the Crown Prince with All Her Heart!"
   },
   {
    "en": "unwanted yet the most loyal"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "All she ever wanted was the happiness of the man who was her first love.\n\nAfter her country was defeated in war, the exiled princess was sent as a political bride to the enemy nation, becoming the wife of the Crown Prince. At first, people were captivated by her beauty, but admiration quickly turned into hatred, fueled by the crimes committed by her homeland.\n\nBut she didn’t care. Her heart belonged to only one person—the Crown Prince, the man who had once given her the first smile she had ever received as a child, abandoned and unwanted within her own palace.\n\nYet, her dream of love shatters when he coldly tells her that he already has a lover, and that their marriage means nothing to him.\n\nTorn between her deep love and her desire for his happiness, she resolves to bury her feelings… but can she really do so?\n\nA heartfelt romance filled with complex emotions and sacrifices, where the heroine loves a man who doesn’t see her… or perhaps, not yet!"
  },
